I also simplified the sample entrypoint to use a clearer `contains` API instead of exposing node objects through search ([b_tree.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/046_b_tree/b_tree.java:201)). Verification was done with `javac b_tree.java` and `java -cp . Main`; output remained:
